The trainer files under trainer/ carry their own SPDX headers. sft_12hz_lora_mlflow.py and dataset.py derive from
the Qwen team's Qwen3-TTS fine-tuning example (Apache-2.0, "Copyright 2026 The Alibaba Qwen team"), with this
project's LoRA, voice-baking and checkpointing changes.

WHAT IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY, by construction

  - No audio, audio codes, transcripts, clip ids, file names or manifests. The user downloads Common Voice
    themselves; Mozilla Data Collective's terms forbid re-hosting and identifying contributors.
  - No model weights. The released weights ship with the release, not here.
  - Nothing from research-only corpora (MCE, yue_emo) or anything derived from them.

